{"protocol":"mindblown-brain/1","brain":"projects","page":{"id":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide","title":"Moon Fox Field Guide","type":"project","lobe":"moons","parent":null,"desc":"Spin-off fact book in the series' art style with night covers.","intro":"Spin-off fact book in the series' art style with night covers.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-14","synapses":["projects/moon-fox-field-guide#1","projects/moon-fox-field-guide#2","projects/moon-fox-field-guide#3","projects/moon-fox-field-guide#4","projects/moon-fox-field-guide#5","projects/moon-fox-field-guide#6","projects/moon-fox-field-guide#7","projects/moon-fox-field-guide#8"],"sources":["pplx://sessions/cd8ff1ae-b085-bc48-86df-3f5d014fec2f","pplx://sessions/d2886bdc-2642-bfbb-afba-f9201d4e6c4b","pplx://sessions/336d81a2-60e4-feaa-ddfd-eb1c077b56bc","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/paper-moons-site/pull/29","https://docs.example.org/marine-forecast-api"],"sections":["How it works","See also"]},"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Fmoon-fox-field-guide","parent":null,"children":[],"synapses":[{"id":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide#1","page":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide","lead":"Separate hardcover spread ownership","text":"hardcover spread changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check in the pilot is bounded evidence, not proof that the review page works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/336d81a2-60e4-feaa-ddfd-eb1c077b56bc"]},{"id":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide#2","page":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide","lead":"Spine width stays explicit","text":"the hardcover spread is derived from the spine width across four books; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/paper-moons-site/pull/29","pplx://sessions/d2886bdc-2642-bfbb-afba-f9201d4e6c4b"]},{"id":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide#3","page":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide","lead":"Bounded continuity note evidence","text":"continuity note changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check in the pilot is bounded evidence, not proof that the proof copy works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/d2886bdc-2642-bfbb-afba-f9201d4e6c4b"]},{"id":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide#4","page":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide","lead":"Reader download before imagination mode","text":"the reader download preserves per spread, but this does not establish imagination mode acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/paper-moons-site/pull/29","https://docs.example.org/marine-forecast-api"]},{"id":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide#5","page":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide","lead":"Animatic beat with a visible gate","text":"animatic beat changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check on the public reader is bounded evidence, not proof that the imagination mode works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/336d81a2-60e4-feaa-ddfd-eb1c077b56bc","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/paper-moons-site/pull/29"]},{"id":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide#6","page":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide","lead":"Reader download before night cover","text":"reader download changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check across four books is bounded evidence, not proof that the night cover works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/rain-barrel-controller"],"cites":["https://docs.example.org/marine-forecast-api"]},{"id":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide#7","page":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide","lead":"Review page stays explicit","text":"Sam chose to keep the review page and the spine width distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://ses